    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy elimination</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/container-with-most-water/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 11</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Container With Most Water</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Start with the widest container and always throw away the shorter wall: no narrower container that keeps it can ever hold more. Each step kills a whole row of pairs, so n - 1 checks replace n²/2. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
